    "description": "A charming cottage-style home in an ideal Bernal Village location, North of Cortland and South of Bernal Heights Park welcomes you with bright, airy ambiance, private garden retreat, and stylish updates. Just off the entrance, a cozy living room showcases paneled walls and neutral wood flooring. The updated eat-in kitchen features sleek quartz countertops, built-ins, and stainless steel Kenmore/KitchenAid appliances. The upgraded full bathroom offers spa-like comfort with a jetted soaking tub and new vanity. This home includes two inviting bedrooms plus a versatile back room, perfect for a home office or creative space. Step onto the private deck and relax in a serene backyard filled with blooming flowers, succulents, and lush greenery. Additional details: laundry room,  AC and architectural plans to extend the back of the home. Enjoy the best of city living near Bernal Heights Park, Cortland Avenue's vibrant shops and restaurants, and convenient freeway access!"
  },
